# Over the Hills and Far Away (sandoria 112): Antreneau's guard, one operand false at a time (each script talk follows a
# default talk), at fame level 8 (550) with A Taste for Meat completed. DiaryPage 3: no arm. DiaryPage 4, The Medicine
# Woman available: no arm. A Taste for Meat set available, then accepted (GM; accepted alone over a completed quest
# keeps it completed): not completed, and none of its C# states answers Antreneau: no arm. Completed again, its var
# Option 2 (GM): A Taste for Meat's 530 wants 1, and Antreneau's guard wants 0: no arm. Option 1: A Taste for Meat's
# completed state (main's ATasteForMeat.cs) answers first with 530 (the hare, Option 0). Then the default, and with
# every operand true: 725, begun.
char zone=PortSanDoria pos=-70,-5.5,-41.1 lvl=75
quest Sandoria.ATasteForMeat completed
fame Sandoria 550
charvar DiaryPage 3
login
quest Sandoria.TheMedicineWoman completed
trigger Antreneau                         # default
trigger Antreneau                         # DiaryPage 3: no arm: the default
charvar DiaryPage 4
quest Sandoria.TheMedicineWoman available
trigger Antreneau                         # default
trigger Antreneau                         # The Medicine Woman available: no arm: the default
quest Sandoria.TheMedicineWoman completed
quest Sandoria.ATasteForMeat available    # a GM (accepted alone keeps the completed bit)
quest Sandoria.ATasteForMeat accepted     # a GM: not completed, and none of its states answers
trigger Antreneau                         # default
trigger Antreneau                         # A Taste for Meat not completed: no arm: the default
quest Sandoria.ATasteForMeat completed
charvar Quest[0][100]Option 2             # a GM
trigger Antreneau                         # default
trigger Antreneau                         # Option 2: no arm: the default
charvar Quest[0][100]Option 1
trigger Antreneau                         # Option 1: A Taste for Meat's completed state answers first: 530
finish                                    # its finish: a Slice of Grilled Hare, Option 0 (its C#)
trigger Antreneau                         # default
trigger Antreneau                         # Option 0 again, all the guards hold, available: 725
finish option=0                           # begun
